  # Energy Weapons Specifications
  Notes:
  - For burst-fire or capacitor-limited weapons, firerate shows burst RPS (shots per burst / cooldown).
  - For munitions that are fired at a static speed, range is simply launch velocity * projectile lifetime.
  - RPS may not be accurate due to it being capped by server tick speed (usually 20 or 30 ticks/second).

